{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And they went out and blessed, etc.</b> Perhaps they were so commanded through prophecy. Or this blessing was in place of prayer, in order that the Shechinah might rest. And although Aaron had already blessed them, the two together are good, by way of the conjunction of two levels alluded to in the two aspects of the brothers — priesthood and Levite-ness — which are Chesed and Gevurah:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:54:42.442690008Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}